'''Avernic treads''' are boots that require level 80 in [[Defence]], [[Strength]], [[Ranged]], and [[Magic]] to wear. They are dropped in their base form by the [[Doom of Mokhaiotl]], and can be upgraded into stronger variants.

In their base form, the treads already surpass each of the [[Primordial boots|primordial]], [[Eternal boots|eternal]], and [[pegasian boots]] in accuracy and most defensive bonuses as well as providing a ranged strength bonus. However, they have slightly less strength bonus than the primordial boots and no [[prayer]] bonus compared to [[aranea boots]].

The treads can be upgraded by adding a pair of primordial, eternal, and pegasian boots onto them. Each pair is added separately, and 4,000 [[demon tear]]s are required per pair, for a total of 12,000 demon tears.

