==Trivia==
* The word "Avernic" refers to a specific race of [[demons]] which consists of the more standard demons such as [[lesser demon]]s, [[greater demon]]s, and [[black demon]]s. The other piece of equipment with Avernic in the name, the [[Avernic defender hilt]] (used to make the [[Avernic defender]]), was created by Avernic demon smiths in their homeworld of [[Infernus]].
** Based on the treads appearing to have wings and spikes like most Avernic demons do, it is possible that the treads were crafted from the body of a demon, rather than being created by one like the Avernic defender hilt.

